00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Twin Snakes Sacrifice...</font>

142
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:49,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You intend to commit suicide?</font>

143
00:14:01,270 --> 00:14:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substitution.</font>

144
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you are a Special Jonin
of the village,</font>

145
00:14:23,670 --> 00:14:27,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can't be just using
the forbidden Jutsu I taught you.</font>

146
00:14:30,970 --> 00:14:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you it wouldn't work.</font>

147
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why have you come now?</font>

148
00:14:49,150 --> 00:14:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's our reunion after so long,
and you're awfully cold.</font>

149
00:14:54,790 --> 00:14:58,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me that you came
to assassinate Hokage-sama?</font>

150
00:14:58,500 --> 00:14:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no...</font>

151
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:02,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have enough
subordinates for that yet...</font>

152
00:15:03,290 --> 00:15:07,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard of the excellence ones of
this village and thought I'd put dibs on it.</font>

153
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A little while ago,</font>

154
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:17,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gave that same Curse Mark
as a present.</font>

155
00:15:19,270 --> 00:15:21,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a kid that I want.</font>

156
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Selfish as always.</font>

157
00:15:24,730 --> 00:15:26,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid will die.</font>

158
00:15:27,110 --> 00:15:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Certainly... the odds are 1 in 10
that he'll die,</font>

159
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he may survive just like you did.</font>

160
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:38,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kid, you really like him, huh?</font>

161
00:15:40,370 --> 00:15:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you jealous?.</font>

162
00:15:42,210 --> 00:15:43,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

163
00:15:43,790 --> 00:15:48,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you still holding a grudge
that I used you and threw you away?</font>

164
00:15:51,010 --> 00:15:54,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike you, that kid will excel.</font>

165
00:15:54,430 --> 00:15:58,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For one thing he inherited
the Uchiha ability.</font>

166
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:04,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has beautiful features and is
a vessel who can become my heir.</font>

167
00:16:05,310 --> 00:16:08,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that kid lived,
it will make things interesting.</font>

168
00:16:09,690 --> 00:16:13,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be sure not to cancel this test.</font>

169
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:18,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three people from my village
are also under your care.</font>

170
00:16:19,160 --> 00:16:20,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make me enjoy it.</font>

171
00:16:23,580 --> 00:16:27,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If something happens to
deprive me of my fun,</font>

172
00:16:28,380 --> 00:16:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">consider it the end of Leaf Village.</font>

173
00:16:43,310 --> 00:16:46,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've secured food and water after
spending half a day</font>

174
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and now most teams have halted activity.</font>

175
00:16:51,490 --> 00:16:53,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As we planned,
this is the time that we attack.</font>

176
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:57,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll split up into three and go scouting.</font>

177
00:16:57,070 --> 00:17:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, whether we find
other teams or not,</font>

178
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:03,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we return to this place.</font>

179
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it?</font>

180
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

181
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:07,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger.</font>

182
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

183
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:10,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scatter!</font>

184
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:23,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His breathing is gradually
getting regular...</font>

185
00:17:23,850 --> 00:17:25,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he still has a terrible fever.</font>

186
00:17:37,410 --> 00:17:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to protect them both.</font>

187
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to communicate this
to Hokage-sama right away.</font>

188
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:31,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! At a time like this!</font>

189
00:19:01,620 --> 00:19:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This is Paralysis Jutsu.</font>

190
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:07,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you are here, Anko.</font>

191
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:21,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're pretty late for ANBU Black Ops.</font>

192
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, don't say that.</font>

193
00:19:28,730 --> 00:19:30,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, hey?</font>

194
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:32,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? T-This is...!</font>

195
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:35,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark is appearing...</font>

196
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me...?!</font>

197
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:38,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it Orochimaru?</font>

198
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:41,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, really?</font>

199
00:19:42,740 --> 00:19:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that it's come to this,
we'll take you to Hokage-sama.</font>

200
00:19:46,870 --> 00:19:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, take me to the tower.</font>

201
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

202
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The moment Orochimaru comes
to this village,</font>

203
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a strict alert is issued.</font>

204
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's more urgent than
continuing the Exam.</font>

205
00:19:56,750 --> 00:19:57,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...</font>

206
00:19:59,170 --> 00:20:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, I'll tell the whole story later,
so please call for Hokage-sama.</font>

207
00:20:16,060 --> 00:20:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found you.</font>

208
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:21,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As Orochimaru-sama ordered,
we'll wait for daybreak to do it.</font>

209
00:20:22,570 --> 00:20:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke is our target,
not the other.</font>

210
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they come in the way,
it's okay to kill the other two, right?</font>

211
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:30,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course.</font>

212
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

213
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

214
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

215
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

216
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

217
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

218
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

219
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

220
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

221
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

222
00:21:42,950 --> 00:21:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

223
00:21:42,950 --> 00:21:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">You won't have to search around you</font></b></font></font></font>

224
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:50,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mou iin da yo</font></b></font></font>

225
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:50,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">it's all ok now</font></b></font></font></font>

226
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kono to no naka ni wa minna ga iru kara</font></b></font></font>

227
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">everyone is inside this hand</font></b></font></font></font>

228
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">naki taku natte nige taku natte</font></b></font></font>

229
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you want to cry, and you want to run away</font></b></font></font>

230
00:22:05,170 --> 00:22:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">shiawase o wasure te te shimatta ra</font></b></font></font>

231
00:22:05,170 --> 00:22:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you forget what happiness is</font></b></font></font>

232
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mina utae</font></b></font></font>

233
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">just sing</font></b></font></font>

234
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hikari ga umare yami ga umare ta</font></b></font></font>

235
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">light is born, and darkness was born</font></b></font></font>

236
00:22:18,940 --> 00:22:21,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">futatsu wa hitotsu</font></b></font></font>

237
00:22:18,940 --> 00:22:21,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the two are one</font></b></font></font>

238
00:22:21,270 --> 00:22:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">HARUMONIA kanji Te TEREPASHII</font></b></font></font>

239
00:22:21,270 --> 00:22:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">harmonia, feel the telepathy</font></b></font></font>

240
00:22:27,990 --> 00:22:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font></font>

241
00:22:27,990 --> 00:22:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

242
00:22:36,500 --> 00:22:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">The beautiful wild beast of Leaf Village,
Rock Lee, is here!</font>

243
00:22:40,420 --> 00:22:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Yeah, I did it!
I did it, Guy-sensei!</font>

244
00:22:43,210 --> 00:22:46,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Now I can get Sakura-san's heart,
right on the mark!</font>

245
00:22:48,380 --> 00:22:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You could say, in terms of numbers,
the disadvantage is mine!</font>

246
00:22:51,430 --> 00:22:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But on the contrary,
the conditions have been met.</font>

247
00:22:53,850 --> 00:22:57,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Guy-sensei, I will use that technique
without hesitation.</font>

248
00:22:58,690 --> 00:23:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"Super Eyebrow Platonic! I Will Protect You to the Death!!"</font>

